feat(ml): keep departed source-folder CLIP vectors, read-only lookup (G3 Task 2) — PARKED

Parked, unmerged and unreviewed: the G3 before run (2026-10-13) measured
CLIP on the moved files at <= 1.2 s of a 119.8 s sort, so the user
re-scoped G3 to the 71 videos that make every sort retrain. Kept here
in case source-CLIP reuse is picked up again (it needs Task 3 and a
task review first).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>


